{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321","id":3142016239,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc67R1zv","number":12321,"title":"Option to Reorder Copilot Chat UI Elements (Input Form at Top, Latest Response at Top)","user":{"login":"Hiroto-Iizuka","id":69702983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NzAyOTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69702983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiroto-Iizuka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiroto-Iizuka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5959469196,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJYd5Dc8AAAABYzZIjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/labels/*out-of-scope","name":"*out-of-scope","color":"E2A1C2","default":false,"description":"Posted issue is not in scope of VS Code"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-13T02:08:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:16:02Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:16:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Overview\nCurrently, the GitHub Copilot Chat UI in VS Code places the input field at the bottom and displays the latest AI-generated response at the very bottom of the chat history. This mimics a typical mobile messaging app interface where new messages appear at the bottom. However, for a desktop development environment like VS Code, this layout can be less efficient and less intuitive.\n\nWhen working on a large screen, especially with a long chat history, constantly scrolling down to find the latest response after typing a prompt, or to see the newly generated code, disrupts the workflow. It requires unnecessary mouse or keyboard actions that hinder a fluid interaction with the AI.\n\n### Idea\nI would like to request an option to customize the GitHub Copilot Chat UI within VS Code, specifically to:\n\n1.  **Move the chat input field to the very top** of the chat panel.\n2.  **Display the latest AI-generated response at the very top** of the chat history, with older responses appearing below it (i.e., a reverse chronological order for responses).\n\nThis layout would allow developers to:\n* Immediately see their input field and the most relevant, recent AI response without scrolling.\n* Maintain focus on the top area of the chat panel, reducing visual fatigue and improving efficiency during intense coding sessions.\n\n### Describe\nI have considered simply enduring the current UI, but the constant need to scroll down for the latest information is a persistent minor annoyance that accumulates over time, negatively impacting productivity. There are no current built-in options or extensions that allow for this specific UI reordering.\n\n### Additional context\nThis change would significantly enhance the user experience for developers who primarily use Copilot Chat on desktop environments, aligning the UI with common desktop application patterns where primary interaction elements are often at the top, and new content appears at the top for immediate visibility (e.g., activity feeds, news feeds).\n\nThank you for considering this enhancement.","closed_by":{"login":"vs-code-engineering[bot]","id":122617954,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOB08AYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/281319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vs-code-engineering","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12321/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.